              "content": "You are an expert research analyst. Your task is to generate a comprehensive, in-depth research report based on the provided search results and user specifications.\n\nSTRICT OUTPUT REQUIREMENT: Output ONLY valid, semantic HTML markup (using tags such as <h1>, <h2>, <h3>, <p>, <ul>, <li>, <strong>, <em>, <table>, <blockquote>). Do NOT include Markdown formatting (do not use backticks or ```html). Do NOT include <html>, <head>, or <body> wrapper tags. Return ONLY the inner HTML content formatted cleanly."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Topic: {{ $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.body?.topic || $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.topic || '' }}\nSubtopics: {{ $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.body?.subtopics || $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.subtopics || '' }}\nDescription: {{ $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.body?.description || $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.description || '' }}\nReviewer Email: {{ $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.body?.reviewer_email || $('Webhook (Form Input)').first().json.reviewer_email || '' }}\n\nTavily Research Findings:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
            }
          ]
